  displayName: Fiend
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b90578b74a780c54d8a4fc8ce2780c0d, type: 3}
  description: Fiends are medium-sized demons, roughly human in height, with twisted
    horns or spines and a sinuous tail. They bear no wings, preferring to stalk on
    foot with a steady, predatory stride. Their voices are cold, cruel speech, often
    calm even in violence, promising torment or making formal pacts in unnervingly
    measured tones.
